<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cemenco share listing to be suspended Wed.</title>
<headline>Cemenco share listing to be suspended Wed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Tuesday that it would suspend the share listing of Cementation Company (Africa) Limited from start of business on Wednesday, at the request of the Cemenco directors.</p>
<p>The exchange said the move was pending clarity on Cemenco's consolidated results for the year to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>It said Cemenco was expected to make an announcement within five business days.</p>
<p>-- Johaneesburg newsroom (27-11) 482-1003</p>
